Subject: [PATCH 3/5] docs: document phase 2b sandbox boundaries

Record that Phase 2B is a fail-closed AppContainer prototype around the
Host-owned Test Worker, not third-party execution. Job Object is resource
containment only. Staged runtime is copied, never hardlinked, and ACL is
staging-only. Real Windows TokenIsAppContainer proof is REQUIRED / NOT RUN.
execution_supported and os_sandbox_ready remain false.
